    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000th4k](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000th4k) Magnitude 5.6 earthquake at 154.355 depth occurred on Jul 31 2026 13km NE of Pucallpa. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -8.3349 longitude -74.4353. It impacted 20445 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
